<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Architecture on 断念梦的站点</title><link>https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/8.%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/Architecture/</link><description>Recent content in Architecture on 断念梦的站点</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 22:24:09 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/8.%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/Architecture/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Architecture</title><link>https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/8.%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/Architecture/Architecture/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/8.%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/Architecture/Architecture/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="概述"&gt;概述&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#%e6%a6%82%e8%bf%b0" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;参考：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Computer_architecture"&gt;Wiki, Computer Architecture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
